{"id":"000VW6","title":"Nine Ate Seven – The Revenge of Nine","author":"GiAnMMV","solvedCount":7,"difficulty":2,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-08T15:19:29+00:00","posted":"Heute, 10:15 Uhr","rules":"Rules:\n• Classic Sudoku: Every row, column and 3x3 box must contain every number from 1 to 9.\n• Nine Ate Seven: The following rules apply to 7, 8 and 9:• Nine Eats Seven: If a 7 and a 9 on the same row/column are one cell apart, the digit between them must be an 8.\n• Seven Flees From Nine: 7 and 9 are never orthogonally adjacent.\n• Nine Only Eats Seven: If 9 and 8 are adjacent, the digit on the other side of 8 must be a 7.\n• Only Nine Eats Seven: If 7 and 8 are adjacent, the digit on the other side of 8 must be a 9.\n\n• Kropki: Two digits separated by a white dot are consecutive; two digits separated by a black dot have a 1:2 ratio.\nPlay in SudokuPad\n\n← More puzzles by GiAnMMVRandom Puzzle","solutionCode":"Row 8, left to right.","tags":["Sudoku","Kropki"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/farnf42xzk","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/farnf42xzk","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["overlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-08T15:19:29+00:00"}